{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DdNhrkCptzV4At9W2ZmjeV","type":"tool_result","content":"68:6. Is base64 encoding a form of encryption? If not, what is it for?\n87:6. **No.** Base64 is a transport encoding: a way to represent arbitrary binary data using a restricted set of text characters. It is trivially reversible by anyone, requires no key, and provides no confidentiality whatsoever. Hold onto that answer; §4 will want it.\n151:[Omitted long matching line]\n456:[Omitted long matching line]\n569:- **B is the most seductive** of the three because a volume feels live in a way an environment variable does not, and in some configurations the projected file content does eventually change on disk. The application still has to be written to notice, though, and a container using a ConfigMap as a `subPath` volume mount will not receive updates at all [source: k8s-docs-volumes-2026-08-23]. Treating \"it's a volume, so it's live\" as a rule will burn you."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5a71be12-5e8e-49d8-8169-5c316e76d768","uuid":"6f333177-ed3f-4f18-b04f-0b051f514bc4","timestamp":"2026-08-24T09:06:47.347Z","tool_use_result":{"mode":"content","numFiles":0,"filenames":[],"content":"68:6. Is base64 encoding a form of encryption? If not, what is it for?\n87:6. **No.** Base64 is a transport encoding: a way to represent arbitrary binary data using a restricted set of text characters. It is trivially reversible by anyone, requires no key, and provides no confidentiality whatsoever. Hold onto that answer; §4 will want it.\n151:[Omitted long matching line]\n456:[Omitted long matching line]\n569:- **B is the most seductive** of the three because a volume feels live in a way an environment variable does not, and in some configurations the projected file content does eventually change on disk. The application still has to be written to notice, though, and a container using a ConfigMap as a `subPath` volume mount will not receive updates at all [source: k8s-docs-volumes-2026-08-23]. Treating \"it's a volume, so it's live\" as a rule will burn you.","numLines":5,"totalLines":5}}
